<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>　　Unselected topic<BR>
　A topic you have never selected yet<BR>
<BR>
　　Choices<BR>
　A topic that has choices<BR>
<BR>
　　Unlocking topic<BR>
　By selecting this topic, you can unlock another related topic<BR>
<BR>
　　Unlocked topic<BR>
　A topic unlocked by selecting another topic<BR>
<BR>
　　Choice-unlocking topic<BR>
　By selecting a particular choice, you can unlock another topic. However, if you reselect a different choice while that topic has appeared, the unlocked topic returns to its locked state.<BR>
<BR>
　　Choice-unlocked topic<BR>
　A topic unlocked by selecting a particular choice in a particular topic. However, if you reselect a different choice in the unlocking topic, this topic returns to its locked state.<BR>
<BR>
　　Topic in season<BR>
　A topic that can no longer be selected once the scenarios have advanced to a certain point. Miss its season and it can never be selected again. Please select it early.<BR>
<BR>
　　One-time topic<BR>
　A topic that can be selected only once. Once selected, it can never be selected again.<UNDENT><BR>
<BR>
　　Affection-changing topic<BR>
　A topic in which particular choices change affection<BR>
<BR>
　　Info button<BR>
　Displays a list of information on the chatter so far.<BR>
<BR>
<BR>
※1<BR>
　All topics are unlocked by advancing the main scenarios. Even if the conditions above are met, a topic will not unlock while your scenario progress lags behind.<BR>
<BR>
※2<BR>
　Note that when you advance to a particular scenario, all topics change. Once the topics change, past topics never appear again.<BR>
<BR>
※3<BR>
　Basically, affection rises as you select new topics.<BR>
<BR>
※4<BR>
　Topics grayed out and unselectable lack the affection needed.<BR>
<BR>
※5<BR>
　Right-clicking a topic displays its summary.<BR>
<BR>
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
